tools/hy4_dequant/hy4_iq_dequant_vendor.h is adapted from
ggml/src/ggml-common.h and ggml/src/ggml-quants.c of llama.cpp at that commit:
the tables kmask_iq2xs, ksigns_iq2xs, iq2xxs_grid, iq3xxs_grid, iq1s_grid and
kvalues_iq4nl, the table macros GGML_TABLE_BEGIN and GGML_TABLE_END, and the
constants NGRID_IQ1S, IQ1S_DELTA and QK_K; the block layouts block_q4_K,
block_q5_K, block_q6_K, block_iq4_xs and block_iq4_nl; and the routines
dequantize_row_iq2_xxs, dequantize_row_iq3_xxs, dequantize_row_iq1_m,
dequantize_row_q4_K, dequantize_row_q5_K, dequantize_row_q6_K,
dequantize_row_iq4_xs and get_scale_min_k4. Changes: the routines carry a hy4_
prefix, the ggml types and GGML_FP16_TO_FP32 are replaced by plain C structs
and hy4_fp16_to_fp32 (IEEE binary16), and the source comments are removed.
